{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the year 1920 - a lone sorceress named Crystal Piquet was called to a mysterious abandoned mansion.  She was determined to improve her magical abilities and begins her journey to the cursed mansion....</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using her magical<strong>\u00a0CARD BASED MAGIC</strong>, Crystal fights her way through monsters and ghouls to reach the top of the mansion, where she believes a secret that could help her become stronger lies in wait....</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you up to the task to trek this cursed mansion...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the halls of the mansion in<strong> EXPLORE MODE</strong>, solving puzzles and clearing obstacles in your way. Search furnature to find<strong> </strong><i>Gears</i>\u00a0and other machanical tools to assist on your journey, but they aren't the only things hiding in the mansion...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963010/extras/50bf8e377e9ff41630545ed75314f9b5.avif?t=1774411005\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way forward in<strong> BATTLE MODE</strong>, using a card-based battle system where magical cards are collected and harnessed for combat! Total higher numbers together to pack higher punches, and level up to unlock over 20 unique<i> Special Cards</i>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963010/extras/e789d1107882c2d5948e22c003691525.avif?t=1774411005\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the secrets of the mansion and your own abilities in Team Wowasaurs<strong><i> Wraith of the Cards</i></strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements